# Trivy findings ignored repo-wide. One finding ID per line.

# AVD-DS-0026: "No HEALTHCHECK defined" (LOW). HEALTHCHECK can only execute a
# command; the distroless static base has no shell and no curl/wget, so
# there's no command it could run. Cloud Run also never reads a Dockerfile
# HEALTHCHECK: it uses its own startup/liveness probes instead.
AVD-DS-0026
